# Atlas parcellation volumes are build artifacts rather than tracked files, consolidated under tvbo/database/atlases (see tvbo/data/tvbo_data/__init__.py); the Desikan-Killiany raster is tracked because a curated figure's volume panel reads it, no fetch produces it and templateflow carries no volume segmentation for this template, so a fresh checkout could not draw that figure at all.
