# Generated LinkML datamodel — produced at build time by hatch_build.py (and by
# `make gen-linkml` for a from-source checkout). Not tracked so it never conflicts
# on merges or drifts from schema/tvbo_datamodel.yaml.
tvbo/datamodel/schema.py
tvbo/datamodel/pydantic.py
tvbo/datamodel/tvbo_datamodel.schema.json
tvbo/datamodel/dialect_tables.py
tvbo/datamodel/_stamp.py
# Copy of schema/study_layout.yaml, materialized by the same hook so a wheel can read it.
tvbo/rules/

# Derived ontology, rebuilt by `make gen-owl` / `gen-shacl` / `gen-abox`; untracked so it cannot lag its sources, and so a new linkml changes the output without changing the index.
ontology/tvb-o-struct.owl
ontology/tvb-o.shacl.ttl
ontology/tvb-o-data.ttl
ontology/tvb-o-biology.ttl

# Build artifacts
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Compiled modules a doc builds for itself: platform- and interpreter-specific, so a committed one is wrong for everyone else.
docs/**/*.so

# Animations `PDESimulation.qmd` rewrites on every render; `docs/Models/_output/anim1.gif` is still tracked.
docs/Networks/_output/*.gif

# Local Claude Code state, including the GENERATED `.claude/skills/` tree. The two
# skill sources of truth are tracked: `tvbo/skills/canonical/` (ships in the wheel)
# and `skills/` (maintainer-only). `.claude/skills/` is only ever a `tvbo skills sync`
# render of those, as is `.cursor/rules/`, so neither belongs in the index.
.claude
.cursor

# Scratch renders left by `tvbo export pyrates` runs.
pyrates_run__*.py

# Generated by `make docs-kernel`: a kernelspec pinned to this checkout, so docs execute against it rather than whatever venv PATH finds.
.docs-kernel/
